OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be mostly dry
OL,6,Fwith sunny periods and only the chance
OL,7,Fof a shower in the west. Any showers
OL,8,Fwill clear as cloud increases during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with clear spells in the
OL,12,Fevening. Cloud will increase from the
OL,13,Flate evening and outbreaks of light
OL,14,Frain or drizzle will spread east
OL,15,Ftowards morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FPatchy rain and drizzle clears
OL,18,Fbriefly then outbreaks of rain, some
OL,19,Fheavy and persistent, spread east
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
